#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Circuit functions {#circuit-functions}"
msgstr "Fungsi litar {#circuit-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Name | Provider | Recommended use | Unique benefits |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Tensor-Network Error Mitigation<br/><br/><ul><li>[Guide](/guides/algorithmiq-tem)</li><li>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/algorithmiq-tem)</li></ul>      | Algorithmiq  | Workloads that have low-weight observables and loop-free circuits. | Reduces measurement overhead and variance, outperforming standard error mitigation baselines such as Zero Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) and Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC) for relevant circuit classes. |\n"
"| QESEM: Error Suppression and Error Mitigation<br/><br/><ul><li>[Guide](/guides/qedma-qesem)</li><li>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/qedma-qesem)</li></ul>    | Qedma        | Workloads that  include circuits with fractional or parameterized gates, high-weight observables,  and workflows that require unbiased expectation values and accurate runtime estimates. | Produces unbiased expectation values with lower variance and resource overhead, outperforming ZNE and PEC for relevant circuit classes. |\n"
"| Performance Management<br/><br/><ul><li>[Guide](/guides/q-ctrl-performance-management)</li><li>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/q-ctrl-performance-management)</li></ul> | Q-CTRL       | Workloads that contain parametric circuits, deep circuits, or require many circuit executions. | Automatically applies AI-driven error suppression to quantum algorithms, maximizing the performance of IBM devices to deliver accurate results while reducing the number of shots, compute time, and cost required. <br/><br/>Zero-overhead method that improves execution accuracy for the Sampler and the Estimator primitives, compatible with any weight of observables. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nama | Penyedia | Penggunaan yang disyorkan | Kelebihan unik |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Tensor-Network Error Mitigation<br/><br/><ul><li>[Panduan](/guides/algorithmiq-tem)</li><li>[Rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/algorithmiq-tem)</li></ul>      | Algorithmiq  | Beban kerja yang mempunyai boleh cerap berpemberat rendah dan litar bebas gelung. | Mengurangkan overhed pengukuran dan varians, mengatasi garis asas mitigasi ralat standard seperti Zero Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) dan Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC) untuk kelas litar yang berkaitan. |\n"
"| QESEM: Penindasan Ralat dan Mitigasi Ralat<br/><br/><ul><li>[Panduan](/guides/qedma-qesem)</li><li>[Rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/qedma-qesem)</li></ul>    | Qedma        | Beban kerja yang merangkumi litar dengan get pecahan atau berparameter, boleh cerap berpemberat tinggi, dan aliran kerja yang memerlukan nilai jangkaan tidak berat sebelah serta anggaran masa jalan yang tepat. | Menghasilkan nilai jangkaan tidak berat sebelah dengan varians dan overhed sumber yang lebih rendah, mengatasi ZNE dan PEC untuk kelas litar yang berkaitan. |\n"
"| Pengurusan Prestasi<br/><br/><ul><li>[Panduan](/guides/q-ctrl-performance-management)</li><li>[Rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/q-ctrl-performance-management)</li></ul> | Q-CTRL       | Beban kerja yang mengandungi litar berparametrik, litar dalam, atau memerlukan banyak pelaksanaan litar. | Secara automatik menerapkan penindasan ralat dipacu AI pada algoritma kuantum, memaksimumkan prestasi peranti IBM untuk menghasilkan keputusan yang tepat sambil mengurangkan bilangan tembakan, masa pengiraan, dan kos yang diperlukan. <br/><br/>Kaedah sifar-overhed yang meningkatkan ketepatan pelaksanaan untuk primitif Sampler dan Estimator, serasi dengan sebarang berat boleh cerap. |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"application\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"application\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Application functions {#application-functions}"
msgstr "Fungsi aplikasi {#application-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Name | Provider | Recommended use | Unique benefits |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| QUICK-PDE<br/><br/><ul><li>[Guide](/guides/colibritd-pde)</li><li>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/colibritd-pde)</li></ul> | ColibriTD            | Use quantum computation for multi-physics PDEs.<br/><br/>Prepare simulation workflows for quantum hardware, while keeping full control over both quantum and physical modeling parameters.                     | Offers a robust hybrid VQA framework that delivers precise, scalable PDE solutions through advanced solution encoding and spectral methods, making it an ideal entry point for teams trying to build quantum-ready simulation capabilities. |\n"
"| Quantum Portfolio Optimizer <br/><br/><ul><li>[Guide](/guides/global-data-quantum-optimizer)</li><li>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/global-data-quantum-optimizer)</li></ul>  | Global Data Quantum  | Workloads for financial optimization, seeking optimal portfolio strategies over time while minimizing risk and maximizing returns, enabling trading strategy back-testing.                                   | Solves combinatorial optimization problems through a highly specialized adaptation of the VQE quantum algorithm for this financial use case, using optimized execution strategies and optimizers, along with noise-aware error mitigation techniques tailored to portfolio optimization. |\n"
"| HI-VQE Chemistry<br/><br/><ul><li>[Guide](/guides/qunova-chemistry)</li><li>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/qunova-chemistry)</li></ul>   | Qunova Computing     | Workloads in computational chemistry, molecular simulation, materials science, or any Hamiltonian simulation that require solving many-body electronic structure problems.                                   | Solves molecular electronic structures by using enhanced SQD with achieving chemical accuracy (1 kcal/mol, 1.6 mHa) for problems modeled with 40 to 60 qubits, outperforming some classical solutions on supercomputers or standard SQD in convergence speed or accuracy, respectively, by orders of magnitude.                                                                                                                                               |\n"
"| Iskay Quantum Optimizer<br/><br/><ul><li>[Guide](/guides/kipu-optimization)</li><li>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/kipu-optimization)</li></ul> | Kipu Quantum         | Optimization workloads such as  scheduling, logistics, routing, and QUBO/HUBO problems. <br/><br/>  | Integrated tunable classical pre- and post-processing methods for the quantum optimization routine. <br/><br/>Delivers runtime advantage over classical solvers (CPLEX, simulated annealing, and tabu search) on selected HUBO benchmarks. <br/><br/>Market Split `ms_5_100`, a hard challenge, solved within hours (see [this tutorial](/tutorials/solve-market-split-problem-with-iskay-quantum-optimizer)).                                        |\n"
"| Singularity Machine Learning<br/><br/><ul><li>[Guide](/guides/multiverse-computing-singularity)</li><li>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity)</li></ul>  | Multiverse Computing | Classical machine learning classification workflows that could benefit from improved accuracy or computational efficiency by leveraging quantum optimization executed on IBM hardware.               | Delivers accuracy comparable to or exceeding classical models such as Random Forest or XGBoost, while operating with significantly fewer learners and a more compact ensemble. <br/><br/>Powered by quantum-optimized voting, it selects the most informative learners and refines decision boundaries, resulting in greater efficiency, reduced model complexity, and more robust performance. |\n"
"| Optimization Solver<br/><br/><ul><li>[Guide](/guides/q-ctrl-optimization-solver)</li><li>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/q-ctrl-optimization-solver)</li></ul>             | Q-CTRL               | Binary optimization problems or any combinatorial problem that can be mapped to a binary cost function.  <br/><br/>Cost functions of any order and problem sizes up to the maximum device scale are supported. | Noise-aware, end-to-end quantum optimization solution that enables inputs of high-level problem definitions and automatically finds accurate solutions to classically challenging combinatorial problems on utility-scale quantum hardware. <br/><br/>It abstracts away complexity by handling error suppression, efficient mapping, and hybrid quantum-classical optimization to solve optimization tasks at full device scale without deep quantum expertise. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nama | Penyedia | Penggunaan yang disyorkan | Kelebihan unik |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| QUICK-PDE<br/><br/><ul><li>[Panduan](/guides/colibritd-pde)</li><li>[Rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/colibritd-pde)</li></ul> | ColibriTD            | Gunakan pengiraan kuantum untuk PDE berbilang fizik.<br/><br/>Sediakan aliran kerja simulasi untuk perkakasan kuantum, sambil mengekalkan kawalan penuh ke atas parameter pemodelan kuantum dan fizikal.                     | Menawarkan rangka kerja VQA hibrid yang mantap yang menghasilkan penyelesaian PDE yang tepat dan berskala melalui pengekodan penyelesaian lanjutan dan kaedah spektral, menjadikannya titik masuk yang ideal bagi pasukan yang cuba membina keupayaan simulasi bersedia kuantum. |\n"
"| Pengoptimum Portfolio Kuantum <br/><br/><ul><li>[Panduan](/guides/global-data-quantum-optimizer)</li><li>[Rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/global-data-quantum-optimizer)</li></ul>  | Global Data Quantum  | Beban kerja untuk pengoptimuman kewangan, mencari strategi portfolio optimum dari masa ke masa sambil meminimumkan risiko dan memaksimumkan pulangan, membolehkan ujian balik strategi perdagangan.                                   | Menyelesaikan masalah pengoptimuman kombinatorial melalui adaptasi khusus algoritma kuantum VQE untuk kes penggunaan kewangan ini, menggunakan strategi pelaksanaan dan pengoptimum yang dioptimumkan, bersama teknik mitigasi ralat peka hingar yang disesuaikan untuk pengoptimuman portfolio. |\n"
"| Kimia HI-VQE<br/><br/><ul><li>[Panduan](/guides/qunova-chemistry)</li><li>[Rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/qunova-chemistry)</li></ul>   | Qunova Computing     | Beban kerja dalam kimia pengiraan, simulasi molekul, sains bahan, atau sebarang simulasi Hamiltonian yang memerlukan penyelesaian masalah struktur elektronik banyak jasad.                                   | Menyelesaikan struktur elektronik molekul dengan menggunakan SQD yang dipertingkatkan untuk mencapai ketepatan kimia (1 kcal/mol, 1.6 mHa) bagi masalah yang dimodelkan dengan 40 hingga 60 qubit, mengatasi beberapa penyelesaian klasik pada superkomputer atau SQD standard dalam kelajuan penumpuan atau ketepatan, masing-masing mengikut magnitud.                                                                                                                               |\n"
"| Pengoptimum Kuantum Iskay<br/><br/><ul><li>[Panduan](/guides/kipu-optimization)</li><li>[Rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/kipu-optimization)</li></ul> | Kipu Quantum         | Beban kerja pengoptimuman seperti penjadualan, logistik, penghalaan, dan masalah QUBO/HUBO. <br/><br/>  | Kaedah pra dan pasca-pemprosesan klasik boleh laras yang bersepadu untuk rutin pengoptimuman kuantum. <br/><br/>Menyampaikan kelebihan masa jalan berbanding penyelesai klasik (CPLEX, simulasi penyepuhlindapan, dan carian tabu) pada penanda aras HUBO terpilih. <br/><br/>Market Split `ms_5_100`, cabaran sukar, diselesaikan dalam masa beberapa jam (lihat [tutorial ini](/tutorials/solve-market-split-problem-with-iskay-quantum-optimizer)).                                        |\n"
"| Pembelajaran Mesin Singularity<br/><br/><ul><li>[Panduan](/guides/multiverse-computing-singularity)</li><li>[Rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity)</li></ul>  | Multiverse Computing | Aliran kerja pengelasan pembelajaran mesin klasik yang boleh mendapat manfaat daripada ketepatan yang lebih baik atau kecekapan pengiraan dengan memanfaatkan pengoptimuman kuantum yang dilaksanakan pada perkakasan IBM.               | Menghasilkan ketepatan yang setanding atau melebihi model klasik seperti Random Forest atau XGBoost, sambil beroperasi dengan bilangan pemelajar yang jauh lebih sedikit dan ensembel yang lebih padat. <br/><br/>Dikuasakan oleh pengundian yang dioptimumkan secara kuantum, ia memilih pemelajar yang paling bermaklumat dan memperhalusi sempadan keputusan, menghasilkan kecekapan yang lebih tinggi, kerumitan model yang berkurang, dan prestasi yang lebih kukuh. |\n"
"| Penyelesai Pengoptimuman<br/><br/><ul><li>[Panduan](/guides/q-ctrl-optimization-solver)</li><li>[Rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/q-ctrl-optimization-solver)</li></ul>             | Q-CTRL               | Masalah pengoptimuman binari atau sebarang masalah kombinatorial yang boleh dipetakan ke fungsi kos binari.  <br/><br/>Fungsi kos sebarang peringkat dan saiz masalah sehingga skala peranti maksimum disokong. | Penyelesaian pengoptimuman kuantum hujung ke hujung yang peka hingar yang membolehkan input definisi masalah peringkat tinggi dan secara automatik mencari penyelesaian tepat untuk masalah kombinatorial yang mencabar secara klasik pada perkakasan kuantum berskala utiliti. <br/><br/>Ia mengabstrak kerumitan dengan mengendalikan penindasan ralat, pemetaan cekap, dan pengoptimuman kuantum-klasik hibrid untuk menyelesaikan tugas pengoptimuman pada skala peranti penuh tanpa kepakaran kuantum mendalam. |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Get started with Qiskit Functions {#get-started-with-qiskit-functions}"
msgstr ""
"Mula menggunakan Qiskit Functions {#get-started-with-qiskit-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Premium, Flex, and On-Prem (through the IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users"
" can get started with IBM Qiskit Functions for free, or can procure a "
"license from one of the partners who have contributed a function to the "
"catalog.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna Pelan Premium, Flex, dan On-Prem (melalui API IBM Quantum Platform)"
" boleh mula menggunakan IBM Qiskit Functions secara percuma, atau boleh "
"mendapatkan lesen daripada salah satu rakan kongsi yang telah menyumbangkan "
"fungsi ke katalog.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Request a free trial for third-party Qiskit Functions {#request-a-free-"
"trial-for-third-party-qiskit-functions}"
msgstr ""
"Minta percubaan percuma untuk Qiskit Functions pihak ketiga {#request-a-"
"free-trial-for-third-party-qiskit-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To request a new free trial, navigate to the [Qiskit Functions "
"Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions), and explore the details "
"panel. Click on `Request a free trial` and fill out information required by "
"the Functions partner, including the IBM Cloud `AccessGroupId`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk meminta percubaan percuma baharu, navigasi ke [Katalog Qiskit "
"Functions](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions), dan terokai panel "
"butiran. Klik `Request a free trial` dan isi maklumat yang diperlukan oleh "
"rakan kongsi Functions, termasuk IBM Cloud `AccessGroupId`:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to [IBM Cloud IAM](http://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"
msgstr "Navigasi ke [IBM Cloud IAM](http://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Verify eligibility.\n"
msgstr "Sahkan kelayakan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Switch your account in the top bar to one with the following format: "
"`XXXXXXX - [Organization Name]`\n"
msgstr ""
"Tukar akaun anda di bar atas ke akaun dengan format berikut: `XXXXXXX - "
"[Nama Organisasi]`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Ensure the organization is the same as the one associated with your Premium "
"account.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pastikan organisasi adalah sama dengan yang dikaitkan dengan akaun Premium "
"anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you see \"[Your Name]'s Account\", you are using your _personal_ account,"
" which is not eligible for premium access.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda melihat \"Akaun [Nama Anda]\", anda menggunakan akaun _peribadi_ "
"anda, yang tidak layak untuk akses premium.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access group ID.\n"
msgstr "Cari ID kumpulan akses anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Click a group name.\n"
msgstr "Klik nama kumpulan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Details**.\n"
msgstr "Klik **Butiran**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Copy the access group ID. It should start with `AccessGroup-`.\n"
msgstr "Salin ID kumpulan akses. Ia harus bermula dengan `AccessGroup-`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install Qiskit Functions Catalog client {#install-qiskit-functions-catalog-"
"client}"
msgstr ""
"Pasang klien Katalog Qiskit Functions {#install-qiskit-functions-catalog-"
"client}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To start using Qiskit Functions, install the IBM Qiskit Functions Catalog "
"client:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mula menggunakan Qiskit Functions, pasang klien IBM Qiskit Functions "
"Catalog:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    pip install qiskit-ibm-catalog\n"
"    ```\n"
"1. Retrieve your API key from the [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), and activate your Python virtual environment.  See the [installation instructions](/guides/install-qiskit#local) if you do not already have a virtual environment set up.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    pip install qiskit-ibm-catalog\n"
"    ```\n"
"1. Dapatkan semula kunci API anda dari [papan pemuka IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), dan aktifkan persekitaran maya Python anda.  Lihat [arahan pemasangan](/guides/install-qiskit#local) jika anda belum menyediakan persekitaran maya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <span id=\"save-account\"></span>**If you are working in a trusted "
"Python environment (such as on a personal laptop or workstation),** use the "
"`save_account()` method to save your credentials locally. ([Skip to the next"
" step](#functions-untrusted) if you are not using a trusted environment, "
"such as a shared or public computer, to authenticate to IBM Quantum "
"Platform.)\n"
msgstr ""
"    <span id=\"save-account\"></span>**Jika anda bekerja dalam persekitaran "
"Python yang dipercayai (seperti pada komputer riba atau stesen kerja "
"peribadi),** gunakan kaedah `save_account()` untuk menyimpan kelayakan anda "
"secara tempatan. ([Langkau ke langkah seterusnya](#functions-untrusted) jika"
" anda tidak menggunakan persekitaran yang dipercayai, seperti komputer "
"dikongsi atau awam, untuk mengesahkan jati diri ke IBM Quantum Platform.)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    To use `save_account()`, run `python` in your shell, then enter the "
"following:\n"
msgstr ""
"    Untuk menggunakan `save_account()`, jalankan `python` dalam shell anda, "
"kemudian masukkan yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_catalog import QiskitFunctionsCatalog\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_catalog import QiskitFunctionsCatalog\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    QiskitFunctionsCatalog.save_account(channel=\"ibm_quantum_platform\", token=\"<your-token>\", instance=\"<instance-crn>\")\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    QiskitFunctionsCatalog.save_account(channel=\"ibm_quantum_platform\", token=\"<your-token>\", instance=\"<instance-crn>\")\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Type `exit()`. From now on, whenever you need to authenticate to the "
"service, you can load your credentials with\n"
msgstr ""
"    Taip `exit()`. Mulai sekarang, setiap kali anda perlu mengesahkan jati "
"diri ke perkhidmatan, anda boleh memuatkan kelayakan anda dengan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_catalog import QiskitFunctionsCatalog\n"
"    catalog = QiskitFunctionsCatalog()\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_catalog import QiskitFunctionsCatalog\n"
"    catalog = QiskitFunctionsCatalog()\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"functions-untrusted\"></span>**Avoid executing code on an "
"untrusted machine or an external cloud Python environment to minimize "
"security risks.** If you must use an untrusted environment (on, for example,"
" a public computer), change your API key after each use by deleting it on "
"the [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) page to reduce "
"risk. Learn more in the [Managing user API "
"keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"userapikey&interface=ui) topic. To initialize the service in this situation,"
" expand the following section to view code you can use:\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"functions-untrusted\"></span>**Elakkan melaksanakan kod pada "
"mesin yang tidak dipercayai atau persekitaran Python awan luaran untuk "
"meminimumkan risiko keselamatan.** Jika anda terpaksa menggunakan "
"persekitaran yang tidak dipercayai (misalnya, pada komputer awam), tukar "
"kunci API anda selepas setiap penggunaan dengan memadamnya pada halaman "
"[kunci API IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) untuk mengurangkan "
"risiko. Ketahui lebih lanjut dalam topik [Mengurus kunci API "
"pengguna](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"userapikey&interface=ui). Untuk memulakan perkhidmatan dalam situasi ini, "
"kembangkan bahagian berikut untuk melihat kod yang boleh anda gunakan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"        <AccordionItem title=\"Initialize the service in an untrusted environment\">\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"        <AccordionItem title=\"Mulakan perkhidmatan dalam persekitaran yang tidak dipercayai\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # After using the following code, delete your API key on the IBM Quantum Platform home dashboard\n"
"    catalog = QiskitFunctionsCatalog(token=\"<YOUR_API_KEY>\") # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"      </AccordionItem>\n"
"    </Accordion>\n"
"    <Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"      **Protect your API key!** Never include your key in source code, Python script, or notebook file. When sharing code with others, ensure that your API key is not embedded directly within the Python script. Instead, share the script without the key and provide instructions for securely setting it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"    # After using the following code, delete your API key on the IBM Quantum Platform home dashboard\n"
"    catalog = QiskitFunctionsCatalog(token=\"<YOUR_API_KEY>\") # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"      </AccordionItem>\n"
"    </Accordion>\n"
"    <Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"      **Lindungi kunci API anda!** Jangan sekali-kali masukkan kunci anda dalam kod sumber, skrip Python, atau fail notebook. Apabila berkongsi kod dengan orang lain, pastikan kunci API anda tidak tertanam terus dalam skrip Python. Sebaliknya, kongsi skrip tanpa kunci dan berikan arahan untuk menyediakanya dengan selamat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      If you accidentally share your key with someone or include it in version control like Git, immediately revoke your key by deleting it on the [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) page to reduce risk. Learn more in the [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui) topic.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
"4. After you have authenticated, you can list the functions from the Qiskit Functions Catalog that you have access to:\n"
msgstr ""
"      Jika anda tidak sengaja berkongsi kunci anda dengan seseorang atau memasukkannya dalam kawalan versi seperti Git, segera batalkan kunci anda dengan memadamnya pada halaman [kunci API IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) untuk mengurangkan risiko. Ketahui lebih lanjut dalam topik [Mengurus kunci API pengguna](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui).\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
"4. Setelah anda mengesahkan jati diri, anda boleh menyenaraikan fungsi dari Katalog Qiskit Functions yang anda mempunyai akses:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run enabled functions {#run-enabled-functions}"
msgstr "Jalankan fungsi yang diaktifkan {#run-enabled-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After a catalog object has been instantiated, you can select a function "
"using `catalog.load(provider/function-name)`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah objek katalog dijana, anda boleh memilih fungsi menggunakan "
"`catalog.load(provider/function-name)`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each Qiskit Function has custom inputs, options, and outputs. Check the "
"specific documentation pages for the function you want to run for more "
"information. By default, all users can only run one function job at a "
"time:\n"
msgstr ""
"Setiap Qiskit Function mempunyai input, pilihan, dan output tersuai. Semak "
"halaman dokumentasi khusus untuk fungsi yang ingin anda jalankan bagi "
"maklumat lanjut. Secara lalai, semua pengguna hanya boleh menjalankan satu "
"kerja fungsi pada satu masa:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Check job status {#check-job-status}"
msgstr "Semak status kerja {#check-job-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects Qiskit Runtime workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Function workload's current status.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Pada masa ini, jadual beban kerja IBM Quantum hanya mencerminkan beban kerja Qiskit Runtime. Gunakan `job.status()` untuk melihat status semasa beban kerja Qiskit Function anda.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With your Qiskit Function `job_id`, you can check the status of running "
"jobs. This includes the following statuses:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan `job_id` Qiskit Function anda, anda boleh menyemak status kerja yang "
"sedang berjalan. Ini termasuk status berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`QUEUED`**: The remote program is in the Qiskit Function queue. The queue "
"priority is based on how much you've used Qiskit Functions.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`QUEUED`**: Program jauh berada dalam baris gilir Qiskit Function. "
"Keutamaan baris gilir adalah berdasarkan berapa banyak anda telah "
"menggunakan Qiskit Functions.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`INITIALIZING`**: The remote program is starting; this includes setting up"
" the remote environment and installing dependencies.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`INITIALIZING`**: Program jauh sedang dimulakan; ini termasuk menyediakan "
"persekitaran jauh dan memasang kebergantungan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING`**: The program is running. This also includes several more "
"detailed statuses if supported by specific functions\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING`**: Program sedang berjalan. Ini juga termasuk beberapa status "
"yang lebih terperinci jika disokong oleh fungsi tertentu\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING: MAPPING`**\": The function is currently mapping your classical "
"inputs to quantum inputs\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING: MAPPING`**\": Fungsi sedang memetakan input klasik anda ke input"
" kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`**\": The function is optimizing for the"
" selected QPU. This could include circuit transpilation, QPU "
"characterization, observable backpropagation, and so forth\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`**\": Fungsi sedang mengoptimumkan untuk"
" QPU yang dipilih. Ini boleh termasuk transpilasi litar, pencirian QPU, "
"back-propagation boleh cerap, dan sebagainya\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`**: The function has submitted a job to Qiskit "
"Runtime, and is waiting in the queue\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`**: Fungsi telah menghantar kerja ke Qiskit "
"Runtime, dan sedang menunggu dalam baris gilir\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`**: The function has an active Qiskit Runtime "
"job\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`**: Fungsi mempunyai kerja Qiskit Runtime yang "
"aktif\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`**: The function is post-processing results. "
"This could include error mitigation, mapping quantum results to classical, "
"and so forth\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`**: Fungsi sedang memproses keputusan selepas. "
"Ini boleh termasuk mitigasi ralat, memetakan keputusan kuantum ke klasik, "
"dan sebagainya\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`DONE`**: The program is complete, and you can retrieve result data with "
"`job.results()`.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`DONE`**: Program selesai, dan anda boleh mendapatkan semula data "
"keputusan dengan `job.results()`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`ERROR`**: The program stopped running because of a problem. Use "
"`job.result()` to get the error message.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`ERROR`**: Program berhenti berjalan kerana masalah. Gunakan "
"`job.result()` untuk mendapatkan mesej ralat.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`CANCELED`**: The program was canceled; either by a user, the service, or "
"the server.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`CANCELED`**: Program dibatalkan; sama ada oleh pengguna, perkhidmatan, "
"atau pelayan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve results {#retrieve-results}"
msgstr "Dapatkan semula keputusan {#retrieve-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After a program is `DONE`, you can use `job.results()` to fetch the result. "
"This output format varies with each function, so be sure to follow the "
"specific documentation:\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah program `DONE`, anda boleh menggunakan `job.results()` untuk "
"mengambil keputusan. Format output ini berbeza mengikut setiap fungsi, jadi "
"pastikan untuk mengikuti dokumentasi khusus:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can also cancel a job at any time:\n"
msgstr "Anda juga boleh membatalkan kerja pada bila-bila masa:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List previously run jobs run with Qiskit Functions {#list-previously-run-"
"jobs-run-with-qiskit-functions}"
msgstr ""
"Senaraikan kerja yang telah dijalankan sebelum ini dengan Qiskit Functions "
"{#list-previously-run-jobs-run-with-qiskit-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can use `jobs()` to list all jobs submitted to Qiskit Functions:\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menggunakan `jobs()` untuk menyenaraikan semua kerja yang "
"dihantar ke Qiskit Functions:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you already have the job ID for a certain job, you can retrieve the job "
"with `catalog.get_job_by_id()`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda sudah mempunyai ID kerja untuk kerja tertentu, anda boleh "
"mendapatkan semula kerja tersebut dengan `catalog.get_job_by_id()`:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Fetch error messages {#fetch-error-messages}"
msgstr "Ambil mesej ralat {#fetch-error-messages}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If a program status is `ERROR`, use `job.error_message()` to fetch the error"
" message as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika status program adalah `ERROR`, gunakan `job.error_message()` untuk "
"mengambil mesej ralat seperti berikut:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"

