msgstr ""
"[Terokai fungsi litar](/guides/algorithmiq-tem) untuk membina algoritma dan "
"aplikasi baharu, tanpa perlu mengurus transpilasi atau pengendalian ralat.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Explore application functions](/guides/q-ctrl-optimization-solver) to solve"
" domain-specific tasks, with classical inputs and outputs.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Terokai fungsi aplikasi](/guides/q-ctrl-optimization-solver) untuk "
"menyelesaikan tugas khusus domain, dengan input dan output klasik.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the [API reference "
"documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/index) for Qiskit "
"Functions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lihat [dokumentasi rujukan "
"API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/index) untuk Qiskit "
"Functions.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- For hands-on experience, try out some [tutorials](/tutorials/index#leverage-qiskit-capabilities) that demonstrate Qiskit Functions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"- Untuk pengalaman praktikal, cuba beberapa [tutorial](/tutorials/index#leverage-qiskit-capabilities) yang mendemonstrasikan Qiskit Functions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
